    {
      "local_id": "c-1",
      "text": "天宫的大火又烧了七天，终于熄灭。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "天宫的大火又烧了七天。终于熄灭了。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-2",
      "text": "诸神在废墟与灰烬中只找到两样东西：一块烧焦的石头和一根烧断的金箍。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一根烧断的金箍"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-3",
      "text": "有传闻称，有人听见火中传来的歌声与笑声；也有人称曾看见一道金光和一道紫气缠绕着从火中升起、向天际而去；更多人什么也不说。",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "有人说，曾看见有一道金光和一道紫气缠绕着从火中升起"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-4",
      "text": "观音拿到了那根断金箍，并问如来：「我们的目标已完成，西游可以结束了么？」",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0019/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0019"
      },
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "观音拿到了那根金箍。"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-5",
      "text": "如来手中握着那块石头，反问观音：「你能猜到这个结局么？」",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0057/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0057"
      },
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "如来也问"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-6",
      "text": "观音回答自己未猜出（原文「弟子未猜出」）。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0019/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0019"
      },
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
