      "text": "「她」（阿瑶）说：「如果下雨，这里就会长出花草来吧，我没有种子，如果上天知我心诚，就让石头也开花吧。」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0021/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0021"
      },
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "就让石头也开花吧"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-19",
      "text": "忽然天空一声雷鸣，第一滴雨水落在了她的头上。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "第一滴雨水落在了她的头上"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-20",
      "text": "阿瑶抬起头，喜极而泣，仰天高喊。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0021/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0021"
      },
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "阿瑶喜极而泣，仰天高喊"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-21",
      "text": "阿瑶高喊：「下雨啦！孙悟空，你看……下雨……下雨了……花一定会长出来的！」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0021/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0021"
      },
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "花一定会长出来的"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-22",
      "text": "天空中，黑云后，一条白色的龙翻动着。",
      "certainty": "explicit",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "一条白色的龙翻动着"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-23",
      "text": "远处天兵的战车隆隆驶来，天将喊问：「是谁犯天条在花果山私降雨水！」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": null,
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "是谁犯天条在花果山私降雨水"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-24",
      "text": "小白龙心中想：「唐僧、孙悟空、猪八戒，这是我能为你们做的最后一件事了。」又说「别了，永别了！」",
      "certainty": "reported",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0017/index.json",
        "record_id": "char-0017"
      },
      "revealed_at": 49,
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "path": "source/vol-001/ch-000049.txt",
          "chapter_id": "ch-000049",
          "chapter_order": 49,
          "locator": null,
          "anchor": "这是我能为你们做的最后一件事了"
        }
      ],
      "basis_refs": [],
      "supersedes_refs": []
    },
    {
      "local_id": "c-25",
      "text": "花果山落下的这场雨由小白龙私自降下。",
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "attributed_to_candidate_or_ref": {
        "path": "characters/char-0017/index.json",
